{"key":"allod/suslanger","relations":[{"id":"people","rows":[{"detail":"","key":"character/iz","title":"Aiset-Bek","variant":""},{"detail":"","key":"character/junofil","title":"Baluddin","variant":""},{"detail":"","key":"character/guru","title":"Bruder Augenlos","variant":""},{"detail":"","key":"character/glav","title":"Bruder Khatul","variant":""},{"detail":"","key":"character/zaku","title":"Bruder Namenlos","variant":""},{"detail":"","key":"character/kuzn","title":"Bruder Schmied","variant":""},{"detail":"","key":"character/elder","title":"Erfar Silberzunge","variant":""},{"detail":"","key":"character/merc8","title":"Fayrakh","variant":""},{"detail":"","key":"character/spirit","title":"Geist","variant":""},{"detail":"","key":"character/karh","title":"Kardaur","variant":""},{"detail":"","key":"character/nekro","title":"Kehel","variant":""},{"detail":"","key":"character/merc7","title":"Kharad","variant":""},{"detail":"","key":"character/oldnekro","title":"Kholai","variant":""},{"detail":"","key":"character/hero","title":"Kiran","variant":""},{"detail":"","key":"character/nalo","title":"Odalisque","variant":""},{"detail":"","key":"character/merc10","title":"Sahilia","variant":""}],"title":"Bewohner"},{"id":"person","rows":[{"detail":"","key":"character/glav","title":"Bruder Khatul","variant":""},{"detail":"","key":"character/karh","title":"Kardaur","variant":""},{"detail":"","key":"character/nalo","title":"Odalisque","variant":""}],"title":"Verbundene Figuren"},{"id":"region","rows":[{"detail":"","key":"map/bz15h","title":"Der Turm des alten Nekromanten","variant":""},{"detail":"","key":"map/bz13h","title":"Festung","variant":""},{"detail":"","key":"map/bz16h","title":"Geheimer Handelsplatz","variant":""},{"detail":"","key":"map/bz18h","title":"Höhle - Treffpunkt","variant":""},{"detail":"","key":"map/gz16h","title":"Höhle der Wurmköpfe","variant":""},{"detail":"","key":"map/bz14h","title":"Letzte Zuflucht","variant":""},{"detail":"","key":"map/gz18h","title":"Suslanger und seine Außenbezirke","variant":""},{"detail":"","key":"map/gz15h","title":"Todesschlucht","variant":""},{"detail":"","key":"map/gz19h","title":"Tor zum \"Toten Land\"","variant":""},{"detail":"","key":"map/gz17h","title":"Wüste der Nekromanten","variant":""}],"title":"Orte"}],"versions":[{"guide":"","html":"<article><h1>Suslanger</h1><h2>Schauplatz</h2><p>Suslanger ist eine trockene khadaganische Insel mit wenig Ackerland. Fluss, See, Dämme und Bewässerungskanäle versorgen die Siedlungen. Wachen und Spitzel setzen kaiserliche Erlasse durch. Daneben bestehen Nekromantenlabore, Höhlen der Wurmgesichter und ein versteckter Zufluchtsort entflohener Sklaven. [1, 2, 3]</p><h2>Auf At-Kiras Spur</h2><p>Kiran wird von <a href=\"wiki://character/karh\">Kardaur</a> gefangen genommen, entkommt mit Hilfe von <a href=\"wiki://character/nalo\">Odalisque</a> und findet Schutz bei <a href=\"wiki://character/glav\">Bruder Khatul</a>. Die Spur führt von einem Sammler von Joon-Altertümern zu Nekromanten und dem Geist eines Forschers. Ihre Hinweise erklären die Flucht des vermissten Joon und führen zum Amulett, das schließlich nach Gipath weist. [4, 5, 6, 7, 8, 9, 10]</p><h2>Quellen</h2><p>Grundlage sind die Originaldialoge und Weltbeschreibungen. Die Quellenzahlen verweisen auf die unten aufgeführten Szenen.</p><table data-columns=\"2\"><tr><th>#</th><th>Quellen</th></tr><tr><td>1</td><td>Weltbeschreibung · Suslanger (allod suslanger)</td></tr><tr><td>2</td><td>Weltbeschreibung · Höhle der Wurmköpfe (zone gz16h)</td></tr><tr><td>3</td><td>Weltbeschreibung · Wüste der Nekromanten (zone gz17h)</td></tr><tr><td>4</td><td>Dialog · <a href=\"wiki://character/nalo\">Odalisque</a>, <a href=\"wiki://character/hero\">Kiran</a> (briefing kr60)</td></tr><tr><td>5</td><td>Dialog · <a href=\"wiki://character/nalo\">Odalisque</a>, <a href=\"wiki://character/hero\">Kiran</a> (briefing kr61)</td></tr><tr><td>6</td><td>Dialog · <a href=\"wiki://character/glav\">Bruder Khatul</a>, <a href=\"wiki://character/hero\">Kiran</a> (briefing gl64)</td></tr><tr><td>7</td><td>Dialog · <a href=\"wiki://character/junofil\">Baluddin</a>, <a href=\"wiki://character/hero\">Kiran</a> (briefing jf67)</td></tr><tr><td>8</td><td>Dialog · <a href=\"wiki://character/oldnekro\">Kholai</a> (briefing sn69)</td></tr><tr><td>9</td><td>Dialog · <a href=\"wiki://character/spirit\">Geist</a>, <a href=\"wiki://character/hero\">Kiran</a>, <a href=\"wiki://character/oldnekro\">Kholai</a> (briefing sn69_1)</td></tr><tr><td>10</td><td>Dialog · <a href=\"wiki://character/rick\">Tka Rik (Tka-à-Lithan Richti-à-Nik)</a>, <a href=\"wiki://character/hero\">Kiran</a> (briefing r72_1)</td></tr></table><h2>Bewohner</h2><table data-columns=\"1\"><tr><th>Verwandte Seite</th></tr><tr><td><a href=\"wiki://character/iz\">Aiset-Bek</a></td></tr><tr><td><a href=\"wiki://character/junofil\">Baluddin</a></td></tr><tr><td><a href=\"wiki://character/guru\">Bruder Augenlos</a></td></tr><tr><td><a href=\"wiki://character/glav\">Bruder Khatul</a></td></tr><tr><td><a href=\"wiki://character/zaku\">Bruder Namenlos</a></td></tr><tr><td><a href=\"wiki://character/kuzn\">Bruder Schmied</a></td></tr><tr><td><a href=\"wiki://character/elder\">Erfar Silberzunge</a></td></tr><tr><td><a href=\"wiki://character/merc8\">Fayrakh</a></td></tr><tr><td><a href=\"wiki://character/spirit\">Geist</a></td></tr><tr><td><a href=\"wiki://character/karh\">Kardaur</a></td></tr><tr><td><a href=\"wiki://character/nekro\">Kehel</a></td></tr><tr><td><a href=\"wiki://character/merc7\">Kharad</a></td></tr><tr><td><a href=\"wiki://character/oldnekro\">Kholai</a></td></tr><tr><td><a href=\"wiki://character/hero\">Kiran</a></td></tr><tr><td><a href=\"wiki://character/nalo\">Odalisque</a></td></tr><tr><td><a href=\"wiki://character/merc10\">Sahilia</a></td></tr></table><h2>Verbundene Figuren</h2><table data-columns=\"1\"><tr><th>Verwandte Seite</th></tr><tr><td><a href=\"wiki://character/glav\">Bruder Khatul</a></td></tr><tr><td><a href=\"wiki://character/karh\">Kardaur</a></td></tr><tr><td><a href=\"wiki://character/nalo\">Odalisque</a></td></tr></table><h2>Orte</h2><table data-columns=\"1\"><tr><th>Verwandte Seite</th></tr><tr><td><a href=\"wiki://map/bz15h\">Der Turm des alten Nekromanten</a></td></tr><tr><td><a href=\"wiki://map/bz13h\">Festung</a></td></tr><tr><td><a href=\"wiki://map/bz16h\">Geheimer Handelsplatz</a></td></tr><tr><td><a href=\"wiki://map/bz18h\">Höhle - Treffpunkt</a></td></tr><tr><td><a href=\"wiki://map/gz16h\">Höhle der Wurmköpfe</a></td></tr><tr><td><a href=\"wiki://map/bz14h\">Letzte Zuflucht</a></td></tr><tr><td><a href=\"wiki://map/gz18h\">Suslanger und seine Außenbezirke</a></td></tr><tr><td><a href=\"wiki://map/gz15h\">Todesschlucht</a></td></tr><tr><td><a href=\"wiki://map/gz19h\">Tor zum \"Toten Land\"</a></td></tr><tr><td><a href=\"wiki://map/gz17h\">Wüste der Nekromanten</a></td></tr></table></article>","id":"","image":"71a33a8b76364de0f03cfaf7","image_caption":"Originale Reisekarte","image_kind":"allod","pins":[],"representative_image":false,"title":"Suslanger"}]}
